    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111510/extras/8d6971a24244c23f4647ed0d34602cd2.poster.avif?t=1755286368\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111510/extras/8d6971a24244c23f4647ed0d34602cd2.webm?t=1755286368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111510/extras/8d6971a24244c23f4647ed0d34602cd2.mp4?t=1755286368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Aesthetic Clicker is an engaging clicker game that puts you in control of collecting a variety of Aesthetically themed items like vaporwave items. The premise is straightforward: click on the sun displayed on your screen to earn a random themed item at intervals. The challenge lies in amassing all the unique items available, keeping players engaged as they strive to complete their collection. Aesthetic Clicker offers a blend of casual fun and strategic clicking, making it an ideal choice for anyone looking to unwind while aiming for the ultimate goal of collecting all the items!<br><br>Join the Discord to get up to date announcements and suggest ideas for future items! <br><br>Future features<br><br>-More Items<br>-Workshop integration",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111510/extras/8d6971a24244c23f4647ed0d34602cd2.poster.avif?t=1755286368\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111510/extras/8d6971a24244c23f4647ed0d34602cd2.webm?t=1755286368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3111510/extras/8d6971a24244c23f4647ed0d34602cd2.mp4?t=1755286368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Aesthetic Clicker is an engaging clicker game that puts you in control of collecting a variety of Aesthetically themed items like vaporwave items. The premise is straightforward: click on the sun displayed on your screen to earn a random themed item at intervals. The challenge lies in amassing all the unique items available, keeping players engaged as they strive to complete their collection. Aesthetic Clicker offers a blend of casual fun and strategic clicking, making it an ideal choice for anyone looking to unwind while aiming for the ultimate goal of collecting all the items!<br><br>Join the Discord to get up to date announcements and suggest ideas for future items! <br><br>Future features<br><br>-More Items<br>-Workshop integration",
